{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>And it came to pass at midnight.</b> The second [section]." "Yefet said that the captives who grind at the millstones by day in the prison house, they bring them into a pit at night, and place the millstones over the mouth of the pit, and this is 'after the millstones,' and behold it is like in the prison house."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:33:51.183190810Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}